      "panels": {
        "HTML": "<!--\nCreate an online art gallery of 12 of your favorite pieces of art with descriptions and links to the art on wikipedia using the horizontal card feature. Style the art gallery with a pleasing background aesthetic, and add custom CSS to “frame” your choices with a border. Your art should be displayed as 3x4 for desktop, 4x3 for tablet, and 6x1 for mobile.\n-->\n\n<nav class=\"brown darken-4\">\n  <div class=\"nav-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"brand-logo center\">My Art Gallery</div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<br>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://dynaimage.cdn.cnn.com/cnn/q_auto,w_412,c_fill,g_auto,h_412,ar_1:1/http%3A%2F%2Fcdn.cnn.com%2Fcnnnext%2Fdam%2Fassets%2F190430171751-mona-lisa.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mona_Lisa\">Mona Lisa</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Leonardo Da Vinci</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://www.vangoghgallery.com/img/starry_night_full.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n        <br>\n        <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mona_Lisa\">The Starry Night</a>\n        <div class=\"white-text\">Vincent van Gogh</div>\n        <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://www.claude-monet.com/images/paintings/water-lily-pond-with-japanese-bridge.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water_Lilies_(Monet_series)\">The Water Lily Pond</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Claude Monet</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/The_Persistence_of_Memory.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Persistence_of_Memory\">The Persistence of Memory</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Salvador Dalí</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/13/af/13/13af1302d1e79d2308e9d46375417da4.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diego_Rivera\">The Flower Picker</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Diego Rivera</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Edvard_Munch%2C_1893%2C_The_Scream%2C_oil%2C_tempera_and_pastel_on_cardboard%2C_91_x_73_cm%2C_National_Gallery_of_Norway.jpg/800px-Edvard_Munch%2C_1893%2C_The_Scream%2C_oil%2C_tempera_and_pastel_on_cardboard%2C_91_x_73_cm%2C_National_Gallery_of_Norway.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n        <br>\n        <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Scream\">The Scream</a>\n        <div class=\"white-text\">Edvard Munch</div>\n        <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Meisje_met_de_parel.jpg/800px-Meisje_met_de_parel.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water_Lilies_(Monet_series)\">Girl with a Pearl Earring</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Johannes Vermeer</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://www.christies.com/img/LotImages/2010/NYR/2010_NYR_02355_0012_000(andy_warhol_campbells_soup_can).jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Campbell%27s_Soup_Cans\">Campbell's Soup Can</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Andy Warhol</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://ipaintingsforsale.com/painting-imgs/Mark%20Rothko/big/Untitled%20(I).jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mona_Lisa\">Untitled</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Mark Rothko</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://www.tate.org.uk/art/images/work/L/L03/L03007_10.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n        <br>\n        <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pablo_Picasso\">Bust of a Woman</a>\n        <div class=\"white-text\">Pablo Picasso</div>\n        <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://stackpath.jasminedirectory.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/transverse-line.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wassily_Kandinsky\">Transverse Line</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Wassily Kandinsky</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col l3 m4 s6 center\">\n    <div class=\"valign-wrapper\">\n      <img class=\"responsive-img\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Grant_Wood_-_American_Gothic_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/800px-Grant_Wood_-_American_Gothic_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card brown darken-4\">\n      <br>\n      <a class=\"center white-text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Gothic\">American Gothic</a>\n      <div class=\"white-text\">Grant Wood</div>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
