      "panels": {
        "HTML": "<!--\nMake 12 equally sized cards that stretch into a line on fullscreen, go to 2x6 on tablet, and 4x3 on mobile using the pre-built grid feature in materialize. Then, make a set of 6 2x3 wide information panel cards and icons with matching text which also display as 3x2 on tablet and 6x1 on mobile\n-->\n\n<!-- Solution -->\n\n<div class=\"row center\">\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 red\">1</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 orange\">2</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 teal\">3</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 pink\">4</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 yellow\">5</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 green\">6</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 blue\">7</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 grey\">8</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 brown\">9</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 indigo\">10</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 cyan\">11</div>\n  <div class=\"card col s4 m2 l1 lime\">12</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container row center\">\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">favorite_border</i>\n    <p>I love Juni Learning!</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">code</i>\n    <p>Coding is fun and rewarding</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">language</i>\n    <p>Learn remotely</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">functions</i>\n    <p>Improve at mathematics</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">http</i>\n    <p>Make beautiful websites</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card col s12 m6 l4\">\n    <br>\n    <i class=\"material-icons medium\">share</i>\n    <p>Share with others</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
